title=\"极限解放/不动磐石之躯\"><img alt=\"技能背景 史诗.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png/65px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E5%8F%B2%E8%AF%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png/98px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E5%8F%B2%E8%AF%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n    <div data-type=\"@悬浮框/极限解放\" data-name=\"不动磐石之躯\" class=\"bili-tt gx_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E7%A3%90%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E8%BA%AF\" title=\"极限解放/不动磐石之躯\"><img alt=\"极限解放 不动磐石之躯.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4b/jfxgggdf8wdpqv1eh095r9av89qr36s.png/65px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E7%A3%90%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E8%BA%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4b/jfxgggdf8wdpqv1eh095r9av89qr36s.png/98px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E7%A3%90%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E8%BA%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4b/jfxgggdf8wdpqv1eh095r9av89qr36s.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n    <div class=\"gx_name\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E7%A3%90%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E8%BA%AF\" title=\"极限解放/不动磐石之躯\"><font color=\"#FFF\">不动磐石之躯</font></a></div>\n    </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:15%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色绰号\n</th>\n<td>狮子王、老狮子等\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配置推荐\n</th>\n<td>✦技能：从下到上：右右左左右右，1阶推荐领悟之力双选<br />✦武器：专武、千军破阵枪、枯骨之枪<br />✦装具：老登盾、沙漏<br />✦塔罗：死神或恶魔\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色攻略\n</th>\n<td>【by Azhar-_-】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vJLK6mEYt\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vJLK6mEYt</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">中文CV\n</th>\n<td>孟祥龙\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">日文CV\n</th>\n<td>菊池通武\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配音展示\n</th>\n<td>【by ThAmeReborn】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Jt5Y6PEmC\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Jt5Y6PEmC</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色生平\n</th>\n<td>金狮之主阿尔曼，纵横部落纷争数十年的冰原霸主。凭借纯正的血统，和压倒性的绝对战力，他在冰原人眼中如烈阳般不可直视，也是永远不败的神话。<br />\n<p>他信奉着物竞天择这一简洁而古老的冰原法则，却也是第一个试图统一冰原的人。第二次光辉之战中，阿尔曼力主各部落联合，共同抵御法皇国。然而联盟下的诸部落各自为战，战败之后便迅速土崩瓦解。他自此笃信，唯有绝对的强权，才能带来真正的统一与和平。<br />\n此后十余年，他耐心布局，为金狮部落一统冰原扫除着一切障碍——包括那个在他眼中具备强者的力量与勇气，却过于天真的伊凡……<br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>角色像素模型</th>\n<th>变身像素模型\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50%;\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E6%9B%BC_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"阿尔曼 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bb/hqv3u2whkint7famd45021y2g09ltwf.png/100px-%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E6%9B%BC_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/bb/hqv3u2whkint7famd45021y2g09ltwf.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-hei